        """
        Regression test for https://github.com/astropy/astropy/issues/14424

        Floats should be formatted using Python's shortest round-trip
        representation (`str(value)`) rather than a fixed `.16G` format, which
        can expand values like 0.009125 to 0.009124999999999999 and
        unnecessarily truncate comments.
