# Regression test for https://github.com/astropy/astropy/issues/15076\
# When one operand has a mask and the other does not, arithmetic should\
# simply propagate the existing mask rather than calling ``handle_mask``\
# with a ``None`` mask (which fails for operations like ``np.bitwise_or``\
